mesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/deeply-concerning-india-condemns-attack-on-vessel-carrying-indian-crew-off-oman-coast/articleshow/134876803.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/deeply-concerning-india-condemns-attack-on-vessel-carrying-indian-crew-off-oman-coast/articleshow/134876803.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T00:50:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134876799,imgsize-250425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owaisi urges 'Muslims voters' to build own leadership, takes aim at SP and Congress]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-urges-muslims-voters-to-build-own-leadership-takes-aim-at-sp-and-congress/articleshow/134874686.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134874686.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a passionate speech to voters in Azamgarh, Asaduddin Owaisi called on minority communities to pursue political autonomy and take charge of their own representation. He criticized the loyalty to long-established parties like Congress and SP, arguing they have failed to advocate for minority rights. Owaisi also examined the historical connections between Nehru and minority leaders, questioning whether current parties genuinely empower these groups.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-urges-muslims-voters-to-build-own-leadership-takes-aim-at-sp-and-congress/articleshow/134874686.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/owaisi-urges-muslims-voters-to-build-own-leadership-takes-aim-at-sp-and-congress/articleshow/134874686.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T23:30:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134875386,imgsize-82056.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Another showdown in Delhi? INDIA bloc to hold protest over CEC; CJP gives 24-hour ultimatum]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/another-showdown-in-delhi-india-bloc-to-hold-protest-over-cec-cjp-gives-24-hour-ultimatum/articleshow/134875018.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134875018.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/another-showdown-in-delhi-india-bloc-to-hold-protest-over-cec-cjp-gives-24-hour-ultimatum/articleshow/134875018.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/another-showdown-in-delhi-india-bloc-to-hold-protest-over-cec-cjp-gives-24-hour-ultimatum/articleshow/134875018.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T23:29:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134875573,imgsize-144740.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Next PM Vijay 2029’: Placards trigger brief stir at PM Modi event in Chennai]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/next-pm-vijay-2029-placards-trigger-brief-stir-at-pm-modi-event-in-chennai/articleshow/134875145.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134875145.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a government event in Chennai, PM Modi and CM Vijay inaugurated significant projects worth approximately Rs 13,000 crore. The gathering was briefly disrupted when supporters displayed placards promoting Vijay as the next Prime Minister. PM Modi emphasized the importance of cooperative federalism and vowed to continue supporting Tamil Nadu's development. Vijay called for the release of central funds and sought approval for additional infrastructure projects.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/next-pm-vijay-2029-placards-trigger-brief-stir-at-pm-modi-event-in-chennai/articleshow/134875145.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/next-pm-vijay-2029-placards-trigger-brief-stir-at-pm-modi-event-in-chennai/articleshow/134875145.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T23:21:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134875456,imgsize-111936.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Less-than-2-lane NH stretches shrink to 8% as high-speed corridors surge]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/less-than-2-lane-nh-stretches-shrink-to-8-as-high-speed-corridors-surge/articleshow/134875126.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134875126.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India's national highway system has undergone remarkable enhancements, reducing two-lane stretches to only 8%. In the past nine years, high-speed corridors have expanded over twelve times. Officials note that newer expressways allow trucks to travel significantly faster than traditional highways. Plans include constructing about 51,000 kilometers of access-controlled corridors in the next ten years, aiming to boost transport efficiency and cut logistics expenses across the nation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/less-than-2-lane-nh-stretches-shrink-to-8-as-high-speed-corridors-surge/articleshow/134875126.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/less-than-2-lane-nh-stretches-shrink-to-8-as-high-speed-corridors-surge/articleshow/134875126.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T23:15:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dipak K Dash</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134875268,imgsize-66473.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tanker with 11 Indians on board attacked in Oman, 2 crew members missing]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vessel-with-11-indians-on-board-attacked-in-oman-2-missing/articleshow/134874613.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134874613.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The tanker MT PETRO DOLPHIN faced an assault while anchored off the coast of Sohar, Oman, with 11 Indian crew aboard. While nine crew members were successfully rescued, two remain unaccounted for. Local Coast Guard authorities have mobilized search-and-rescue operations, with ongoing efforts to find the missing crew members. Minister Sarbananda Sonowal has pledged full support for the rescue efforts underway.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vessel-with-11-indians-on-board-attacked-in-oman-2-missing/articleshow/134874613.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vessel-with-11-indians-on-board-attacked-in-oman-2-missing/articleshow/134874613.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T23:01:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134874888,imgsize-48070.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[CJI Surya Kant rejects INDIA bloc leaders’ request for meeting over ‘vote chori’]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cji-surya-kant-rejects-india-bloc-leaders-request-for-meeting-over-vote-chori/articleshow/134874374.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134874374.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cji-surya-kant-rejects-india-bloc-leaders-request-for-meeting-over-vote-chori/articleshow/134874374.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cji-surya-kant-rejects-india-bloc-leaders-request-for-meeting-over-vote-chori/articleshow/134874374.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T22:36:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134874449,imgsize-39466.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Can't intimidate democracy': CPM MP John Brittas writes to CJI, President &amp; RS chair over Delhi police 'assault']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-intimidate-democracy-cpm-mp-john-brittas-writes-to-cji-president-rs-chair-over-delhi-police-assault/articleshow/134873030.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134873030.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a media interaction, CPI(M) Rajya Sabha MP John Brittas detailed an incident where he was allegedly assaulted by the Delhi Police while protesting for the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar. He has demanded an independent investigation into the matter, highlighting serious breaches of constitutional rights. This incident has triggered widespread protests in the national capital, leading to over 200 detentions as citizens rally against the Election Commission.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-intimidate-democracy-cpm-mp-john-brittas-writes-to-cji-president-rs-chair-over-delhi-police-assault/articleshow/134873030.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-intimidate-democracy-cpm-mp-john-brittas-writes-to-cji-president-rs-chair-over-delhi-police-assault/articleshow/134873030.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T22:08:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134873798,imgsize-267400.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Don't teach us Tamil pride': DMK hits out at Rahul Gandhi over Hindi event title]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-teach-us-tamil-pride-dmk-hits-out-at-rahul-gandhi-over-hindi-event-title/articleshow/134872999.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134872999.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-teach-us-tamil-pride-dmk-hits-out-at-rahul-gandhi-over-hindi-event-title/articleshow/134872999.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-teach-us-tamil-pride-dmk-hits-out-at-rahul-gandhi-over-hindi-event-title/articleshow/134872999.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T21:16:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134873060,imgsize-163054.cms"/></item></channel></rss>